\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.13}{\ignorespaces Orchestrator Control Loop State Machine. WLA = Wrong-Lever Avoidance (C4). The dashed path is structurally impossible in rule-based systems.\relax }}{15}{figure.caption.21}%
